    "body": "@7ombie, we have test cases for Dedicated Worker support in Web Platform Tests so it should work. Note that you cannot call `navigator.usb.requestDevice()` from a worker. You must call it from a window and then call `navigator.usb.getDevices()` in the worker to get the device that was selected by the user.",
